Mobile page-specific class changes deployed alongside styles.css.

Payments.tsx
- Header/actions stack below 640 px.
- Payment table uses `min-w-[780px] table-auto` inside a local `overflow-auto` wrapper.

Clients.tsx
- Header, search controls and modal actions stack on narrow screens.
- Client table uses `min-w-[980px] table-auto` and scrolls inside its card.
- Detail rows and action groups wrap instead of overlapping.

Tasks.tsx
- Header/action buttons and search controls use responsive grids.
- Filter and status tags wrap; task actions move below content on narrow screens.

Services.tsx
- Tabs use a three-column mobile grid.
- Catalog filters are full-width on mobile.
- Catalog table uses `min-w-[980px] table-auto` in local horizontal scrolling.

Inventory.tsx
- Header filters/actions use a responsive two-column grid.
- Item actions wrap; the wide stock table remains inside its own scroll container.

Settings.tsx
- Invite actions stack on mobile and table actions wrap.

Documentation.tsx
- Tabs/actions use a mobile grid.
- History table and row actions are contained and independently scrollable.
